This product includes the compiled seal kernel evaluator (wasm/seal.js,
wasm/seal.wasm) — a black-box WebAssembly build of the verified seal mediation
kernel. The kernel's decision logic is the subject of public Lean 4 proofs.
The compiled artifact is redistributed here as the public "black-box evaluator";
its source build pipeline is not included in this repository.

